2fBeetle_Bulwark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Beetle_Bulwark</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.3169%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fApajQXA.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ApajQXA.png\" alt=\"Beetles ticks and mites\" width=\"299\" height=\"299\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>甲蟲/蜱蟲/蟎</strong></span></p>\n<p>設計靈感來自多種微小節肢動物</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>維基頁面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fBeetleTickMite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/BeetleTickMite</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.6831%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fHrsWyS3.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQ647uG.png\" alt=\"Spider Obstructer\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>蜘蛛阻礙者</strong></span></p>\n<p>設計靈感來自「硬幣」陷阱門蜘蛛</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>維基頁面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpider_Obstructer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spider_Obstructer</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.3169%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252ftTxuuey.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Ex4KLQ.png\" alt=\"Giant Ants\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>螞蟻縱火者變體</strong></span></p>\n<p>設計靈感來自火蟻類型</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>維基頁面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fAnt_Arsonist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Ant_Arsonist</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table style=\"width:100.129534%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.677544%\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hhjD40J.png\" alt=\"Termite Tunnelers\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>白蟻掘進者變體</strong></span></p>\n<p>設計靈感來自築巢大白蟻 (Odontotermes Formosanus) 類型</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>維基頁面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fTermite_Tunneler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Termite_Tunneler</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.310085%\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">許多非標準生物，例如「幻覺」、血蟲、海蜘蛛、竹節蟲、豬籠草等</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_bcbe0d43-0c05-42ad-b170-46848a405444.png\" width=\"565\"></strong></h2>\n<p>关于模组物品及其他详情的信息。ArPhEx 包含许多物品，其疯狂程度不亚于掉落它们的生物！</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以在这里的维基上找到该模组所有物品的列表，以及获取它们的所有信息（配方、掉落物等）：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fItems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Items</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>由于该模组的物品过于复杂，在此全面描述会导致页面信息过载。这里有大量拥有疯狂特殊能力的新装备（例如，可以让你指挥自己蚂蚁族群的蚁王权杖）。</strong></p>\n<p>维基提供了关于所有生物和物品的详尽信息，以及指南！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>维基物品分类链接：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>-&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aWeapons_and_Tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">武器与工具</a></p>\n<p>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aOther_Items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">其他物品</a></p>\n<p>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aBlocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">方块</a></p>\n<p>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aArmour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">盔甲</a></p>\n<p>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCategory%253aInherent_Powers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">能力</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>以下是该模组中包含的一些最强盔甲和武器的抢先预览！：</strong></p>\n<table style=\"width:100.129534%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.929495%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fOpW30t5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OpW30t5.png\" alt=\"Infernal Armour\" width=\"301\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>地狱盔甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fAbyssal_Blade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊之刃</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fInfernal_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Infernal_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.073345%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fK6hMsFZ.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K6hMsFZ.png\" alt=\"Spectral Armour\" width=\"302\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>幽灵盔甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fAscendant_Staff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">升阶法杖</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpectral_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spectral_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.929495%\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Zb1uD9E.png\" alt=\"Juggernaut Armour\" width=\"343\" height=\"204\"></p>\n<p><strong>毁灭者盔甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fOblivion_Ray\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">湮灭射线枪</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fJuggernaut_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Juggernaut_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.073345%\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rE20bXu.png\" alt=\"Umbral Armour\" width=\"300\" height=\"213\"></p>\n<p><strong>幽影盔甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fJudgement_Blaster\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">审判加农炮</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fUmbral_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Umbral_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:51.929495%\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3GL05Md.png\" alt=\"Spacetime Armour\" width=\"300\" height=\"194\"></p>\n<p><strong>时空盔甲（手持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fTemporospatial_Transmitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">时空传输器</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fSpacetime_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Spacetime_Armour</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:48.073345%\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fZOXNCkn.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZOXNCkn.png\" alt=\"Eternal Armour\" width=\"371\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>永恒盔甲（双持 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fAbyss_Ascendant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊升阶之刃</a>）</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>维基页面：</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fEternal_Armour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://arphex.miraheze.org/wiki/Eternal_Armour</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>享受游戏吧！</p>\n<h4><strong>ArPhEx 从一些有史以来最疯狂的模组中汲取了一些灵感，如 Lycanite's Mobs、Orespawn 和 Chocolate Quest。此外，还借鉴了泰拉瑞亚的元素。</strong></h4>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967672/description_b816cb49-55f7-48a2-96e1-85df67dd4f3c.png\" width=\"1281\"></p>\n<p>ArPhEx 附带一个特殊的维度，称为“爬行界”（The Crawling），包含五个生物群系和四个层级，必须通过征服地牢才能穿越。在爬行界和主世界维度中都可以生成多种类似地牢的结构。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><em>爬行界维度</em></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GXEQzrO.jpeg\"></p>\n<p>这是一个美丽却如噩梦般弱肉强食的领域。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fThe_Crawling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">爬行界</a>展现了自然界最残酷和冷漠的一面——即使拥有最强的装备，在这个维度的下层生存也将充满危险。这里有五个生物群系和四个垂直层级，只能通过征服连接各层的特殊地牢来穿越！此外还有危险的天气循环——会出现血雨和浓雾。</p>\n<p>要进入这个维度，需要执行几个步骤。首先，你可以制作一个“<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCrawling_Compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">爬行指南针</a>”，它会引导你前往主世界中一个巨大的结构，中心有一个球体。在这个球体内有四个柱子，你可以用灼烧电荷点燃它们。一旦点燃，只需右键点击中心的“爬行屏障”方块，即可激活一个通往爬行界的传送门！</p>\n<p>要离开这个维度，你可以在顶层找到偶尔生成的传送门结构。其中三分之一由石头方块组成，会将你带回主世界；三分之一由下界岩方块组成，会将你带入下界；还有三分之一由末地石方块组成，会将你带入末地维度。每次都会将你传送到随机位置，因此每次进入爬行界都是一次危险的冒险。</p>\n<p>但更危险的是，如果你试图下降到爬行界的下层！</p>\n<p>当你处于该维度时，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farphex.miraheze.org%252fwiki%252fCrawling_Compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">爬行指南针</a>可以引导你前往当前层级的地牢，无论是去往下一个层级还是返回上一个层级（潜行右键可扫描向上层的地牢）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>爬行界中的五个生物群系：</strong></p>\n<p>爬行树冠 (Crawling Canopy)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LwAsMLN.jpeg\"></p>\n<p>神秘综合体 (Cryptic Complex)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/suc4KZS.png\"></p>\n<p>腐朽沙漠 (Decadent Desert)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yd73dyS.png\"></p>\n<p>蛛网荒原 (Webbed Wasteland)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PWTvV7Z.png\"></p>\n<p>受难隧道 (Tormented Tunnels)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hLI4xSc.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>视频播放列表</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?si=fhEFGI0SEC8W5Vwr&list=PL2ZZY4UiOMQgcKe1kRxDlMQzieOydDdi1\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>我的视频</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xFgL33GHlsw?si=tGjMs_xHBkLk6VLX\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
